  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Combating the Use and Trade of Endangered Species for Traditional Chinese Medicine (TCM)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">To reduce demand for wildlife TCM, raise the awareness of millions of Vietnamese people about the risks associated with wildlife traditional Chinese medicine (TCM), decrease availability of wildlife TCM and the use of wildlife ingredients by TCM practitioners. Replaces award SLMAQM21CA3345.</narrative>
  </description>
